        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "template-installation-smoke"
        },
        "markdown": "# Template Installation Smoke Test\n\n1. Open through the idea graph root.\n2. Confirm the declaration still declares kind idea and the same canonical root.\n3. Confirm the installed workboard renders.\n4. Confirm Smoke Task: Verify Installed Workboard appears in Waiting.\n5. Run reconciliation twice; the second run should make no changes.\n6. Attempt a duplicate installation and confirm the ID collision fails without suffixing."
      }
